(6619135, 987591, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sweet stuff. This is Ursula meets van Gogh. I''ve had visions of taking this photo for ages but just haven''t been able to pull it off anywhere near this level of success. It''s truly beautiful. On top of that it meets the challenge better than most everything else. If it''s not blue I''ll eat my hat.</td>', 'Sweet stuff. This is Ursula meets van Gogh. I''ve had visions of taking this photo for ages but just haven''t been able to pull it off anywhere near this level of success. It''s truly beautiful. On top of that it meets the challenge better than most everything else. If it''s not blue I''ll eat my hat.', '2011-12-15 19:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
